_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"EBonJ5tjkxBEUezwosVlLg","review_id":"UQYV6BpPIHklfeHaFJ7S4Q","date":"2016-02-08T01:54:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9388898611068726,"text_excerpt":"This coffee house is has a great location right on the corner of Race and Magazine. If it's a sunny day you will always see the outdoor seating well occupied. Inside it has more of a scholarly feel - lots of people reading and working on laptops surrounded by a few quiet conversations. I'm not much of a coffee drinker, but I sure do love some good lemonade. Mojo has a good selection of lemonade varieties (ginger, cucumber watermelon and strawberry limeade to name a few). My personal favorite is the classic homemade version - fresh squeezed and mixed when you order. It's delicious and refreshing, especially on a hot NOLA day. If you're in the area and want a special beverage made just for ..."},{"business_id":"EBonJ5tjkxBEUezwosVlLg","review_id":"hITIxR75pYqp62ofGIOOuw","date":"2018-10-31T02:43:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.932974100112915,"text_excerpt":"We were staying down the street from here while visiting NOLA and while walking around Magazine St stumbled across Mojo. We loved the interior, it was very cozy and a great place to just read a book. I ordered one of their brews iced and the guy behind the counter wasn't super talkative but he was friendly. I told him we were visiting from Chicago and he said he hopes we come back on our next visit. I like that they have the option of sweeteners for your coffee: Sugar, Honey, or Simple Syrup. Would like to come back and try their breakfasts. Overall, a great place."},{"business_id":"EBonJ5tjkxBEUezwosVlLg","review_id":"W4FTROoXvjRFAyX4vPEKgg","date":"2011-04-10T20:00:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9322054982185364,"text_excerpt":"I went here this morning after my fav coffee house wasn't open. Its small but eclectic. Looks like it has a nice following because it was packed on a Sunday morning. I ordered a mocha and its good but a little too sweet for me. I will try it again since they have bubble teas on the menu. Nice place to walk to."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"EBonJ5tjkxBEUezwosVlLg","photo_id":"HvM2Pp7FWr7pK865NClQ7A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HvM2Pp7FWr7pK865NClQ7A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8409163355827332},{"business_id":"EBonJ5tjkxBEUezwosVlLg","photo_id":"l3khmZlCPXtq_zP-M1r5WQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/l3khmZlCPXtq_zP-M1r5WQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8383991718292236},{"business_id":"EBonJ5tjkxBEUezwosVlLg","photo_id":"ySOq3jUIWim660SyXwIGVQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ySOq3jUIWim660SyXwIGVQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8383482098579407},{"business_id":"EBonJ5tjkxBEUezwosVlLg","photo_id":"TtHxoU0skmjRmTS5xPyMvQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/TtHxoU0skmjRmTS5xPyMvQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8355504274368286},{"business_id":"EBonJ5tjkxBEUezwosVlLg","photo_id":"ukQY-rcV4bHTNXZFcq0I-w","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/ukQY-rcV4bHTNXZFcq0I-w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8236658573150635}]},"notebook_case":null}
